# Route Guard · IPv6 出站封锁
# 加载到 anchor: com.local.claudeguard
# 放行 loopback / link-local / multicast，其余 IPv6 出站全部丢弃。
# IPv4 路由不受此 anchor 影响。

pass out quick on lo0 inet6 all
pass out quick inet6 from fe80::/10 to any
pass out quick inet6 from any to fe80::/10
pass out quick inet6 from ff00::/8 to any
pass out quick inet6 from any to ff00::/8

block drop out quick inet6 all
